 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-junio-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=e^x(x-2)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula las asíntotas de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Halla los extremos relativos (abscisas donde se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan) y los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Determina, si existen, los puntos de inflexión de la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Verticales:</b> no hay, porque \\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\).</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}e^x(x-2)=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{x-2}{e^{-x}}=\\left[\\frac{-\\infty}{\\infty}\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac1{-e^{-x}}=0\\]<p>\\(y=0\\) es asíntota horizontal en \\(-\\infty\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>. En \\(+\\infty\\), \\(f\\to+\\infty\\) y \\(m=\\lim\\frac{e^x(x-2)}x=+\\infty\\): no hay horizontal ni oblicua.</p><div class='res'>Única asíntota: \\(y=0\\) en \\(-\\infty\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\). Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=e^x(x-2)+e^x=e^x(x-1)=0\\iff\\boxed{x=1}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((1,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Mínimo en \\(x=1\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>, con \\(f(1)=-e\\).</p><div class='res'>Decrece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\), crece en \\((1,+\\infty)\\). Mínimo relativo en \\((1,-e)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f''(x)=e^x(x-1)+e^x=xe^x=0\\iff\\boxed{x=0}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M51.0 40Q67.0 4 83.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(−1) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M133.0 12Q149.0 48 165.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(1) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f''\\) cambia de signo en \\(x=0\\): hay un punto de inflexión, \\(f(0)=-2\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,86.6 22.4,86.7 24.8,86.8 27.3,86.9 29.7,87.0 32.1,87.1 34.5,87.2 36.9,87.4 39.4,87.5 41.8,87.7 44.2,87.8 46.6,88.0 49.1,88.2 51.5,88.4 53.9,88.6 56.3,88.8 58.7,89.0 61.2,89.2 63.6,89.5 66.0,89.8 68.4,90.1 70.8,90.4 73.3,90.7 75.7,91.0 78.1,91.4 80.5,91.8 83.0,92.2 85.4,92.6 87.8,93.1 90.2,93.6 92.6,94.1 95.1,94.6 97.5,95.2 99.9,95.8 102.3,96.4 104.7,97.1 107.2,97.8 109.6,98.5 112.0,99.3 114.4,100.1 116.8,101.0 119.3,101.9 121.7,102.8 124.1,103.8 126.5,104.9 129.0,106.0 131.4,107.1 133.8,108.3 136.2,109.6 138.6,110.9 141.1,112.3 143.5,113.7 145.9,115.2 148.3,116.8 150.7,118.4 153.2,120.1 155.6,121.8 158.0,123.6 160.4,125.4 162.9,127.3 165.3,129.3 167.7,131.3 170.1,133.4 172.5,135.5 175.0,137.6 177.4,139.8 179.8,142.0 182.2,144.2 184.6,146.4 187.1,148.6 189.5,150.8 191.9,152.9 194.3,154.9 196.8,156.9 199.2,158.8 201.6,160.5 204.0,162.0 206.4,163.4 208.9,164.5 211.3,165.2 213.7,165.7 216.1,165.7 218.5,165.2 221.0,164.2 223.4,162.5 225.8,160.2 228.2,156.9 230.6,152.8 233.1,147.5 235.5,141.1 237.9,133.3 240.3,123.9 242.8,112.8 245.2,99.8 247.6,84.5 250.0,66.9 252.4,46.4 254.9,23.0 257.3,-3.9 259.7,-34.5 262.1,-69.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='215.0' cy='165.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='221.0' y='177.7'>mín (1, −e)</text><circle cx='182.5' cy='144.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='164.5' y='140.4'>PI</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 85.2H294.0M182.5 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='52.5' y1='82.2' x2='52.5' y2='88.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='49.5' y='99.2' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='117.5' y1='82.2' x2='117.5' y2='88.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='114.5' y='99.2' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='215.0' y1='82.2' x2='215.0' y2='88.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='99.2' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='247.5' y1='82.2' x2='247.5' y2='88.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='244.5' y='99.2' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='179.5' y1='144.4' x2='185.5' y2='144.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='166.5' y='148.4' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='179.5' y1='55.6' x2='185.5' y2='55.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='166.5' y='59.6' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Punto de inflexión en \\((0,-2)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
