  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-junio-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) una función continua en el intervalo \\([2,3]\\) y \\(F\\) una función primitiva de \\(f\\) tal que \\(F(2)=1\\) y \\(F(3)=2\\). Calcula:",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,75 p.) \\(\\displaystyle\\int_2^3f(x)\\,dx\\)",
     "(0,75 p.) \\(\\displaystyle\\int_2^3(5f(x)-7)\\,dx\\)",
     "(1 p.) \\(\\displaystyle\\int_2^3(F(x))^2f(x)\\,dx\\)"
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por la regla de Barrow<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Barrow: \\(\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a)\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\int_2^3f(x)\\,dx=F(3)-F(2)=2-1=1\\]<div class='res'>\\(1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por la linealidad de la integral:</p>\\[\\int_2^3(5f(x)-7)\\,dx=5\\int_2^3f(x)\\,dx-7\\int_2^3dx=5\\cdot1-7\\cdot1=-2\\]<div class='res'>\\(-2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Como \\(F'=f\\), el integrando es del tipo \\(u^2u'\\), con primitiva \\(\\frac{u^3}3\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Integral inmediata de tipo potencia: \\(\\int F^2\\,F'\\,dx=\\frac{F^3}3\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\int_2^3(F(x))^2f(x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{(F(x))^3}3\\Bigr]_2^3=\\frac{8}3-\\frac13=\\frac73\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\dfrac73\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "def",
     "apartados": "a, b, c"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2012-JUNIO.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-junio-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\2&1&2\\\\1&k&1\\end{pmatrix}\\)",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) ¿Para qué valores del parámetro \\(k\\) no existe la inversa de la matriz \\(A\\)? Justifica la respuesta.",
     "(1,5 p.) Para \\(k=0\\), resuelve la ecuación matricial \\((X+I)\\cdot A=A^t\\), donde \\(I\\) denota la matriz identidad y \\(A^t\\) la matriz traspuesta de \\(A\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>No existe la inversa si \\(|A|=0\\). Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}0&0&1\\\\2&1&2\\\\1&k&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+2 k\\bigr)-\\bigl(1+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=2k-1\\]<div class='res'>No existe la inversa para \\(k=\\frac12\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(k=0\\), \\(|A|=-1\\neq0\\). Multiplico por \\(A^{-1}\\) por la derecha: \\(X+I=A^tA^{-1}\\iff X=A^tA^{-1}-I\\).</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}0&0&1\\\\2&1&2\\\\1&0&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(1+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-1\\]<p>Como \\(|A|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & -1\\\\0 & -1 & 0\\\\-1 & 2 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A^{-1}=-\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & -1\\\\0 & -1 & 2\\\\-1 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & -2\\\\1 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[A^tA^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 2 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & -2\\\\1 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 2 & -4\\\\0 & 1 & -2\\\\0 & 2 & -3\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 2 & -4\\\\0 & 1 & -2\\\\0 & 2 & -3\\end{pmatrix}-I=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 2 & -4\\\\0 & 0 & -2\\\\0 & 2 & -4\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 2 & -4\\\\0 & 0 & -2\\\\0 & 2 & -4\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
