  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-junio-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "De un paralelogramo \\(ABCD\\) conocemos tres vértices consecutivos: \\(A(2,-1,0)\\), \\(B(-2,1,0)\\) y \\(C(0,1,2)\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula la ecuación de la recta que pasa por el centro del paralelogramo y es perpendicular al plano que lo contiene.",
     "(0,75 p.) Halla el área de dicho paralelogramo.",
     "(0,75 p.) Calcula el vértice \\(D\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El centro es el punto medio de la diagonal \\(AC\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Las diagonales de un paralelogramo se cortan en su punto medio.</i>: \\(M(1,0,1)\\). El normal del plano: \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-4,2,0)\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{BC}=(2,0,2)\\),</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{BC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-4&2&0\\\\2&0&2\\end{vmatrix}=(4,\\,8,\\,-4)\\parallel(1,2,-1)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":39,\"el\":14,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[2,-1,0],[-2,1,0],[0,1,2],[4,-1,2]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0.0,-2.0,2.0],[2.6,3.2,-0.6],\"#c2410c\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.6,3.2,-0.6],\"p\",\"#c2410c\",6,0],[\"pt\",[2,-1,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-2,1,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,2],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[4,-1,2],\"D\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,0,1],\"M\",8,14]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 277' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m12ja4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m12ja4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m12ja4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m12ja4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='94.0,151.4 314.0,127.2 246.0,42.7 26.0,66.9' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='120.0' y1='18.0' x2='250.0' y2='223.5' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='256.0' y='223.5' fill='#c2410c' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>p</text><circle cx='94.0' cy='151.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='101.0' y='145.4' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='314.0' cy='127.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='321.0' y='121.2' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='246.0' cy='42.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='253.0' y='36.7' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='66.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='60.9' font-weight='700'>D</text><circle cx='170.0' cy='97.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='178.0' y='111.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='247' x2='13.9' y2='250.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='7.4' y='255.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='247' x2='36.4' y2='249.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='37.8' y='254.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='247' x2='24.0' y2='231.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='230.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,269)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,269)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=1+\\lambda\\\\y=2\\lambda\\\\z=1-\\lambda\\end{cases}\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El área del paralelogramo es el módulo del producto vectorial de dos lados concurrentes:</p>\\[\\text{Área}=|(4,8,-4)|=\\sqrt{96}=4\\sqrt6\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=4\\sqrt6\\approx9{,}80\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[D=A+\\overrightarrow{BC}=(2,-1,0)+(2,0,2)=(4,-1,2)\\]<div class='res'>\\(D(4,-1,2)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: el punto medio de \\(BD\\) es \\((1,0,1)=M\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
