  {
   "id": "matematicas-2012-junio-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) las rectas dadas por \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+y-z=6\\\\x+z=3\\end{cases}\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\dfrac{x-1}{-1}=\\dfrac{y+1}6=\\dfrac z2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Determina el punto de intersección de ambas rectas.",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula la ecuación general del plano que las contiene."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(r\\) a paramétricas: con \\(x=t\\), \\(z=3-t\\), \\(y=6-x+z=9-2t\\). Y \\(s\\equiv(1-\\mu,\\,-1+6\\mu,\\,2\\mu)\\). Igualo:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}t=1-\\mu\\\\9-2t=-1+6\\mu\\\\3-t=2\\mu\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow9-2+2\\mu=-1+6\\mu\\iff\\mu=2,\\ t=-1\\]<p>La tercera se cumple: \\(3+1=4=2\\cdot2\\) ✓.</p><div class='res'>Se cortan en \\((-1,11,4)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&-2&-1\\\\-1&6&2\\end{vmatrix}=(2,\\,-1,\\,4)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(2x-y+4z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\((-1,11,4)\\): \\(-2-11+16+D=0\\iff D=-3\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-24,\"el\":58,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-2.2,17.771,6.293],[-5.777,10.618,6.293],[0.6,7.429,2.307],[4.177,14.582,2.307]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.6,7.429,2.307],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-2.4,13.8,5.4],[0.6,7.8,2.4],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.6,7.8,2.4],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.0,5.0,2.0],[-2.0,17.0,6.0],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-2.0,17.0,6.0],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"pt\",[-1,11,4],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m12jb4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m12jb4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m12jb4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m12jb4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='308.7,26.0 99.0,18.0 90.6,231.9 300.3,239.9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='94.6' y='231.9' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='211.4' y1='70.3' x2='99.5' y2='227.3' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='105.5' y='227.3' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='26.0' y1='